sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor E as Engineer
  participant UI as ItemEditor (renderer)
  participant B as window.reqman (preload)
  participant W as workspace (main)
  participant S as repository-store
  participant X as index-cache
  E->>UI: edits fields, presses Ctrl+S
  UI->>B: saveItem(item, revision it was read at)
  B->>W: IPC ws:saveItem
  W->>W: validate against schema, parent exists, no loop
  W->>S: writeItem(item, expectedRevision)
  S->>S: file changed since read? → ConflictError
  S->>S: write temp file, rename over (atomic)
  W->>X: syncPaths(that file)
  W-->>UI: saved item + new revision + issues
  UI->>UI: table and Git bar refresh (Changes (n))
